  <!-- EXPERIENCE JOURNEY -->
  <section class="cert-journey">
    <div class="cert-journey__container">
        <div class="cert-journey__left">
        <div id="certJourneyCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="false">
            <div class="carousel-inner" id="certJourneyCarouselInner">
            <!-- slides injected by JS -->
            </div>
        
            <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#certJourneyCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
            <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
            </button>
        
            <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#certJourneyCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
            <span class="carousel-control-next-icon"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        </div>          

      <div class="cert-journey__right">
        <h2>Experience Journey</h2>

        <div class="cert-journey__list">
            <button
            class="cert-journey__card is-active"
            type="button"
            data-images='["/images/YCLP1.jpeg",
            "/images/YCLP2.jpeg","/images/YCLP3.jpeg", 
            "/images/YCLP4.jpeg", "/images/YCLP5.jpeg", 
            "/images/YCLP6.jpeg", "/images/YCLP7.jpeg",
            "/images/YCLP8.jpeg", "/images/YCLP9.jpeg",
            "/images/YCLP10.jpeg", "/images/YCLP11.jpeg"]'>
            <h4>Youth Corps Leadership Programme</h4>
            <p class="muted">September 2025 - Present</p>
            <p>The Youth Corps Leadership Programme equips youths with leadership and community engagement skills through hands-on planning and execution of service initiatives. As part of the logistics team, I supported event coordination and operations by working closely with my teammates to manage resources, schedules, and on-ground arrangements for programme activities.</p>
          </button>

          <button
          class="cert-journey__card"
          type="button"
          data-images='["/images/SOT1.jpeg", "/images/SOT2.jpeg", "/images/SOT3.jpeg", "/images/SOT4.jpeg", "/images/SOT5.jpeg"]'>
          <h4>Bangkok School Overseas Trip 2025</h4>
          <p class="muted">November 2025</p>
          <p>I attended the Bangkok Schools Overseas Trip, where I visited industrial sites and universities across Thailand to learn about their technology, education landscape, and work culture. The experience broadened my global perspective and deepened my understanding of how technology and innovation are applied in different cultural contexts.</p>
        </button>  
          
          <button
            class="cert-journey__card"
            type="button"
            data-images='["/images/MX1.jpeg","/images/MX2.jpeg", "/images/MX3.jpeg", "/images/MX4.jpeg"]'>
            <h4>Mission X</h4>
            <p class="muted">June 2025</p>
            <p>I attended Mission X, a 3-day leadership camp held at Nanyang Polytechnic, where I learned about different community sectors through talks and hands-on group challenges. Working with new faces throughout the programme strengthened my teamwork, communication, and problem-solving skills in fast-paced and unfamiliar settings.</p>
          </button>          

          <button
            class="cert-journey__card"
            type="button"
            data-images='["/images/SCDF.jpeg"]'>
            <h4>SCDF Innovation Challenge 2025</h4>
            <p class="muted">May - June 2025</p>
            <p>I participated in the SCDF Innovation Challenge 2025 with my team, Cmd + S, where we designed a tech-driven solution to improve emergency preparedness and response for Singaporeans, including vulnerable communities. Although we did not qualify, the experience strengthened my problem-solving, ideation, and teamwork skills under real-world constraints.</p>
          </button>  
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

